Package: recamera-onvif
Version: 0.2.4
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Seeed Studio <support@seeed.cc>
Description: ONVIF and RTSP gateway for reCamera 2002W
 Exposes the reCamera video pipeline through ONVIF discovery and authenticated RTSP
 so NVRs, VMS platforms, and Home Assistant can add the camera directly.
